        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>2024·美的集团ESG报告 - 战略</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 20px;\n        background-color: #e9ecef;\n        font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        min-height: 100vh;\n    }\n    .spread {\n        display: flex;\n        width: 1400px;\n        height: 950px;\n        background-color: #fff;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .page {\n        width: 50%;\n        height: 100%;\n        padding: 50px 60px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        position: relative;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    \n    /* Left Page Styles */\n    .report-header {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #999;\n        margin-bottom: 50px;\n    }\n    .page-title {\n        font-size: 36px;\n        color: #00b0a6;\n        margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n        font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    .intro-text {\n        font-size: 13px;\n        color: #555;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        margin-bottom: 40px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .text-teal {\n        color: #00b0a6;\n    }\n    \n    .section {\n        margin-bottom: 18px;\n    }\n    .section-header {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n        background-color: #00b0a6;\n        color: #fff;\n        padding: 4px 16px;\n        border-radius: 15px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .section-line {\n        flex-grow: 1;\n        height: 1px;\n        background-color: #00b0a6;\n    }\n    .section-dot {\n        width: 5px;\n        height: 5px;\n        background-color: #00b0a6;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n    }\n    .section-content {\n        background-color: #f7f9fa;\n        padding: 12px 16px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #555;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n\n    /* Right Page Styles */\n    .nav-header {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: flex-end;\n        gap: 15px;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #999;\n        margin-bottom: 50px;\n    }\n    .nav-item {\n        cursor: default;\n    }\n    .nav-item.active {\n        background-color: #00b0a6;\n        color: #fff;\n        padding: 2px 12px;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n    }\n    \n    .table-headers {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: 100px 100px 1fr;\n        gap: 15px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .table-header-pill {\n        background-color: #00b0a6;\n        color: #fff;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 6px 0;\n        border-radius: 15px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .table-row {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: 100px 100px 1fr;\n        gap: 15px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .type-box {\n        background-color: #00b0a6;\n        color: #fff;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        padding: 10px;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .model-box {\n        border: 1px solid #00b0a6;\n        color: #00b0a6;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        padding: 10px;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .desc-box {\n        border: 1px solid #b2e2df;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n        padding: 15px 20px;\n        background-color: #fff;\n    }\n    .desc-box ul {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding-left: 16px;\n        color: #555;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n    }\n    .desc-box li {\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .desc-box li:last-child {\n        margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n    \n    .footnote {\n        font-size: 11px;\n        color: #999;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        position: relative;\n        z-index: 2;\n    }\n    \n    .page-num {\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: 40px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #999;\n        z-index: 2;\n    }\n    .page-num.left {\n        left: 60px;\n    }\n    .page-num.right {\n        right: 60px;\n    }\n    \n    .illustration-placeholder {\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: 0;\n        right: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 350px;\n        border: 2px dashed #ccc;\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        color: #999;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        z-index: 1;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"spread\">\n    <!-- Left Page -->\n    <div class=\"page\">\n        <div class=\"report-header\">2024·美的集团ESG报告</div>\n        \n        <h1 class=\"page-title\">战略</h1>\n        \n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            作为全球运营的企业集团，我们明白气候变化可能会对业务运营产生重大影响。为了更好识别、评估和管控气候变化对业务的潜在影响，我们开展情景分析工作。我们参照联合国政府间气候变化专门委员会（IPCC）等专门机构所公布的气候和转型路径预测，在2030年及2050年的时间范围及全球运营控制业务的边界范围下，针对主要的气候风险和机遇开展相应的影响分析，以此作为气候相关风险管理的坚实基础。以下为气候情景的选用理由及考量因素。识别及评估气候相关风险和机遇的流程及方法请参见下文<span class=\"text-teal\">“风险、影响和机遇管理”</span>章节。\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">碳价格</div>\n                <div class=\"section-line\"></div>\n                <div class=\"section-dot\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"section-content\">\n                随着碳关税政策及各地控排企业相关法令、办法的颁布实施，高碳排放物料供应商可能将转型成本进一步分摊至价值链上下游，而低碳排放供应商或将提高低碳原材料定价，这将对供应链采购成本产生长期结构性影响。同时，随着控排行业覆盖范围持续扩大，各制造基地被纳入地方碳管控体系的可能性正在增加。在日趋严格的降碳考核机制下，碳价波动将进一步推高企业碳排放履约成本与低碳技术改造支出。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">可再生能源</div>\n                <div class=\"section-line\"></div>\n                <div class=\"section-dot\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"section-content\">\n                我们价值链的主要碳排放源集中于能源使用环节。园区可再生能源渗透率将直接决定碳抵消需求规模，在持续强化的降碳考核体系下，可再生能源溢价与碳配额成本的叠加效应，可能使企业碳抵消综合成本产生波动。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">环保型冷媒</div>\n                <div class=\"section-line\"></div>\n                <div class=\"section-dot\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"section-content\">\n                我们环保型冷媒产品全生命周期成本（涵盖研发投入、制造工艺升级、用户运维等环节），特别是研发成本、冷媒回收和再制造成本、产品使用范围三降碳成本等构成要素，将直接影响企业降碳节奏和目标达成。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">产品能效</div>\n                <div class=\"section-line\"></div>\n                <div class=\"section-dot\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"section-content\">\n                在大规模设备更新和消费品以旧换新等政策推动及用户绿色消费意识提升背景下，更高能效产品在研发、生产、使用等环节的成本（包括研发投入、生产制造成本、产品使用范围扩大带来的范围三降碳成本）可能影响整体降碳节奏和目标达成。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"section\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">极端天气</div>\n                <div class=\"section-line\"></div>\n                <div class=\"section-dot\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"section-content\">\n                极端天气频发增加（例如极端高温、极端降水、台风飓风等）可能会短期影响业务运营，影响供应链的稳定性和产品的及时交付能力。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"page-num left\">21</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- Right Page -->\n    <div class=\"page\">\n        <div class=\"nav-header\">\n            <span class=\"nav-item\">关于本报告</span>\n            <span class=\"nav-item\">走进美的</span>\n            <span class=\"nav-item\">可持续发展治理</span>\n            <span class=\"nav-item active\">守护蓝色星球</span>\n            <span class=\"nav-item\">构建和谐社区</span>\n            <span class=\"nav-item\">践行科技尽善</span>\n            <span class=\"nav-item\">共创繁荣生态</span>\n            <span class=\"nav-item\">附录</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"table-headers\">\n            <div class=\"table-header-pill\">情景类型</div>\n            <div class=\"table-header-pill\">参考模型</div>\n            <div class=\"table-header-pill\">情景描述</div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"table-row\">\n            <div class=\"type-box\">低排放情景<br>(1.5-3°C)</div>\n            <div class=\"model-box\">SSP1-2.6</div>\n            <div class=\"desc-box\">\n                <ul>\n                    <li>2024年，国内全国碳交易市场碳价格已达到97.49元/吨²，从中长期碳价走势看，全球碳交易价格有进一步走高的可能性；</li>\n                    <li>2030年前，美的集团自有可再生能源比例将提升至20%，在考虑外购绿电绿证等多组合情景下，可再生能源比例将提升至30%；2030-2050年，可再生能源比例提升依赖于外购；</li>\n                    <li>2030年前，环保型冷媒产品将持续占领全球最主要市场；2030-2050年，环保型冷媒产品比例将超过传统冷媒产品；</li>\n                    <li>2030年及2050年前，二级及以上能效产品将占据全球最主要市场。</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"table-row\">\n            <div class=\"type-box\">高排放情景<br>( > 3°C)</div>\n            <div class=\"model-box\">政策维持<br>现状情景</div>\n            <div class=\"desc-box\">\n                <ul>\n                    <li>不考虑制定内部碳价格；</li>\n                    <li>极端高温将对制冷产品的需求进一步暴增；</li>\n                    <li>极端天气频发将持续影响供应链稳定性。</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"footnote\">\n            ²全国碳价格取自全国碳排放碳市场2024年12月31日收盘价格，详见：https://www.cets.org.cn/。\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"illustration-placeholder placeholder\">\n            [Illustration: Mountains, wind turbines, solar panels, buildings]\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"page-num right\">22</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
